_model: proposition
---
title: Proposition 6
---
order: 6
---
short_label: II.6
---
statement: If a straight line is bisected and a straight line is added to it in a straight line, then the rectangle contained by the whole with the added straight line and the added straight line together with the square on the half equals the square on the straight line made up of the half and the added straight line.
---
proof:
---
body:
